## CANON Addition — Glory = Immortality

**`CANON`:** Practitioners who reach Glory do not age. This has been documented
but not widely discussed — the civilization's Glory practitioners are few enough
that the pattern has been attributed to other factors. The Touren lineage knows
the truth.

**Implication for the series:** The Avengers/Guardians team from the earlier era
are alive at the time of the current novel. They are not prominent — they have
withdrawn from institutional life for reasons of their own — but they exist.
When the filter breaks, they return. The protagonist, by Book 3, may meet the
people who were legendary a few hundred years ago and have been waiting, quietly,
for what Rook's disk was always pointing toward.

