## Touren's Disk — The 600-Year Vessel

### What it is
Rook's disk. Passed through the Touren lineage practitioner-to-practitioner for
600 years. A disk of unknown pre-EMP origin (connection to Mars disk lineage:
`RESERVED`). It has been carried through every generation of the Touren lineage,
each practitioner adding their contact-history to its behavior.

### What the filter's recession has done to it
With the new magical influx — the accelerated filter recession of the last generation —
the disk has changed. The user has not determined how yet. `POSSIBLE`

Candidate behaviors (for owner selection):
- **POSSIBLE A:** The disk now emits the overlay pattern of all three doors
  simultaneously during dormant periods — not just during active door-contact.
  It is advertising the combined-path configuration to anyone who can read it.
- **POSSIBLE B:** The disk has begun initiating contact — slight warmth, directional
  pull, physical behavior the protagonist didn't instruct — as if it recognizes
  the accelerated environment and is responding to the influx itself.
- **POSSIBLE C:** The disk's physical structure has visibly changed. A surface
  marking — something that wasn't visible before — has emerged. Aria Laurent
  matches it to an image in the pre-EMP record.
- **POSSIBLE D:** The disk has begun replaying Rook's last clear memory as a
  tactile sensation during the protagonist's sleep. The fever dream is not a
  one-time event. It is a recurring transmission that becomes clearer each time.

