   366	## 13. Names
   367	
   368	**All canon names are kept**, including Bracken in Ephram's letter. **No new proper names are proposed.** The expansion is designed so that every new person is a role. **Do not name:** any member of Teague's crew (the spear, the bow with the limp, the young one, the older healer of no Path); the steading's woman and the bowman at Thornwater; the carters (the Thornwater carter, the carter's wife, the hide carter); the westbound courier at the ford; the ferryman and his boy; the smith and his boy; the landing broker and his clerk; the hide-woman; the crew of three and the mule-named crew on the wall; the ford-keepers at Oxhollow and Millrace; the miller; the old woman with the knee; the child three stops on; the four unnamed holds on Oryn's route; the six on the rim and the second Anchor specialist; the eleven-bale captain and the north-road woman captain. Site names stay descriptive (the Fallow Ring, the Long Stair, the Drowned Hall, **the fourth site**, unnamed). Fauna stay compound nouns (stillhound, shale-back, wold-wyrm).
