   468	- **The mule** goes north with Oryn on the 281st and returns at Millrace on the 298th. From the fork to Millrace the boxes are carried on backs (ruling 16).
   469	- **The square and the station steps:** Cael never sets foot on them. He never looks at the crown except at the count-of-one.
