   471	- **Karis cannot read the index as a grade** until the 298th. The leaf is not readable on the page before the seventh day of Cleon's week.
   472	- **Vastin has not read the directive or objection** before the shale camp (305th).
   473	- **Cael reads pages the wrong way round** until somewhere on Treswick's stair, and no longer does by the 297th.
   474	- **The clerk** stays unnamed and "do not name" holds. He has not asked three things by the 291st.
