   218	
   219	Lira had been very quiet all this while. She leaned forward on the bench, carefully, with the right foot still out straight, and turned the third order over with one finger so that the back of it showed.
   220	
   221	"Nine weeks of nothing," she said.
   222	
   223	"That is my sentence," said Seln.
   224	
