editions/monroe-1.3/book-01-the-shattered/state/movement-001/AUTHOR-REPORT.md:31:**Fragments & progression.** Arbiter woke at Kindling; after the word it dimmed and settled at the edge of his sight; not consulted since. No declaration, no fragments, no notices. Capability: a trained eye (stances, tells); the unexamined cart-step (instinct only, unwritten — reserved for Lira's question in M2).
