editions/monroe-1.3/book-03-no-path-given/state/movement-001/pre-repair/chapter-05.md:71:"Your first declaration comes at Kindling," he said. "Your Arbiter gives you your Path and your first ability together. After that, new declarations come as you climb. Not every rank brings one. Some do. You'll learn the rhythm of your own Path."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-03-no-path-given/state/movement-001/pre-repair/chapter-05.md:161:He had known since orientation that she was on the track. He had not, until that moment, thought about what that meant. The category had been built for someone. It had been built for her. A guild family's daughter who wanted to sit in lectures before her Kindling, so that when her Arbiter came she would already know the shape of the chart. That was the real use of the hollow circle. He was the one borrowing it.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-02-iron-circuit/state/movement-002/pre-repair/chapter-11.md:39:She did not use it. She did not have time. He was gone, a long clean step to her right, and her staff went through the air where he had been. But she had seen it, and she put it away somewhere behind her breastbone, carefully, the way Cael put a thing in the middle column. *He goes home first.* She would have that tomorrow. Whatever happened tonight, she would have that.
