    10	
    11	## Where we enter
    12	
    13	The cold term, before the midyear recess [B5-reconciled 2026-10-05: season words struck; audit A1]. Eighteen, eight fragments, the doorways quiet. The case has been down from its shelf for days. Five people will come to a stone room two floors below the library by three routes across an hour.
    14	
    15	## What this movement is for
    16	
    17	Discharge Series Secret #2 on schedule and at full weight — objects first, intellect second. Pay the asymmetry debt. Map the truth and its limits honestly. Then spend the circle's one honest man. A quiet-leaning movement by design: the book's hinge needs room; one learning session keeps the bodies in it.
