editions/monroe-1.3/book-03-no-path-given/manuscript/chapter-05.md:127:He had known since orientation that she was on the track; he had not, until that moment, thought about what that meant. The category had been built for someone, and it had been built for her, a guild family's daughter who wanted to sit in lectures before her Kindling so that when her Arbiter came she would already know the shape of the chart. That was the real use of the hollow circle. He was the one borrowing it.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-03-no-path-given/manuscript/chapter-36.md:281:Then, behind his breastbone, something began to settle.
