    49	| The Fractured Path predates the classification system | Book 8 | Ancient records in edge-territory ruins |
    50	| The Compact falsifies Path classifications | Book 6 | Seln's intelligence cache |
    51	| The Arbiter system is the Architect's infrastructure | Book 9 | Fractured Path practitioner's tomb |
    52	| The Architect's will is active and hunting Cael | Book 11 | Direct encounter |
